Official MITRE ATT&CK reference:

[T1110 — Brute Force](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/)

---

## Technique Overview

Brute-force activity involves attempts to gain access to accounts by systematically attempting authentication credentials.

Observable authentication behavior may include:

- Repeated failed logons
- Multiple passwords attempted against one account
- Authentication attempts against multiple accounts
- High authentication-failure frequency
- Failed authentication followed by successful authentication

DET-002 focuses on one observable component:

```text
Repeated Failed Authentication
against
TargetUserName
```

within a short detection window.

