# Observable Behavior

DET-002 focuses on:

```text
One Target Account
       |
       v
Repeated Authentication Failures
       |
       v
Short Time Period
       |
       v
Potential Credential Attack
```

The lab threshold is:

```text
>=5 failed authentication events
within
5 minutes
```

This threshold is intended only for the controlled lab.

---

# Detection SPL

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
```

Portfolio output:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
| eval detection="DET-002 - Repeated Failed Authentication"
| table detection TargetUserName failures
```

